+#      - D15-only complement-ALL would also keep it because target 9 is missing;
+#      - this combo deletes it because it contains no exclusion color at all.
+#    * {0,2,5,9}:
+#      - original task keeps it;
+#      - D15-only complement-ALL deletes it;
