    27	#      - original task would keep it because it does not contain all shown legend colors;
    28	#      - D15-only complement-ALL would also keep it because target 9 is missing;
    29	#      - this combo deletes it because it contains no exclusion color at all.
    30	#    * {0,2,5,9}:
    31	#      - original task keeps it;
    32	#      - D15-only complement-ALL deletes it;
